&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;2qq1z5&quot; data-start=&quot;2405&quot; data-end=&quot;2416&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2418&quot; data-end=&quot;2789&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;s6bpph&quot; data-start=&quot;2418&quot; data-end=&quot;2442&quot;&gt;Unlimited annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xdcm9g&quot; data-start=&quot;2443&quot; data-end=&quot;2469&quot;&gt;Up to 5% matched pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1k5pjwr&quot; data-start=&quot;2470&quot; data-end=&quot;2517&quot;&gt;Phantom equity – share in Graphcore’s success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;29x8ds&quot; data-start=&quot;2518&quot; data-end=&quot;2562&quot;&gt;True flexibility in how and where you work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18jz13s&quot; data-start=&quot;2563&quot; data-end=&quot;2605&quot;&gt;Office spaces designed for collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
